  "tinai": "unknown",
  "sangamTamil": "சிறுகாலை யேதமக்குச் செல்வுழி வல்சி\nஇறுகிறுகத் தோட்கோப்புக் கொள்ளார் - இறுகிறுகிப்\nபின்னறிவாம் என்றிருக்கும் பேதையார் கைகாட்டும்\nபொன்னும் புளிவிளிங்கா யாம்.",
  "urai": null,
  "english": "The miser's death-bed. In the very earliest time (in early youth) they take not food for the journey which they must make (into another world), tying tightly the wallet on their shoulders ; but tying tightly (their treasure bags), they say, 'In after days we will learn wisdom;' the gold these idiots will indict with their hands (as legacies, when they are speechless, and in the grasp of death) will be as sour vilam fruit.",
